/**
 * @mainpage Foundation Documentation
 *
 * Foundation provides reusable software components designed for
 * resource-constrained embedded systems as well as desktop
 * applications.
 *
 * @section FoundationArchitecture Architecture
 *
 * The framework is divided into multiple modules:
 *
 * - @ref Foundation_TypeTraits
 * - @ref Foundation_Math
 * - @ref Foundation_Time
 * - @ref Foundation_Containers
 * - @ref Foundation_Functional
 * - @ref Foundation_System
 *
 * Each module is intended to remain as independent as possible
 * in order to minimize compile times and reduce unnecessary
 * dependencies.
 *
 * @section FoundationBuild Building Foundation
 *
 * See:
 *
 * - @ref FoundationBuildGuide
 *
 * @section FoundationExamples Examples
 *
 * See:
 *
 * - @ref Foundation_Examples
 *
 * @section FoundationRepository Repository Structure
 *
 * @code
 * Foundation/
 * ├─ docs/
 * ├─ examples/
 * ├─ src/
 * ├─ tests/
 * ├─ scripts/
 * └─ CMakeLists.txt
 * @endcode
 */